{'symbol': 'OTIS', 'date': '2021-04-19 16:36:00', 'title': 'OTIS ANNOUNCES A 20 PERCENT INCREASE IN QUARTERLY DIVIDEND TO $0.24 PER SHARE', 'text': "FARMINGTON, CONN., APRIL 19, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE OTIS WORLDWIDE CORPORATION (NYSE: OTIS) BOARD OF DIRECTORS TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.24 PER SHARE OF OTIS' COMMON STOCK, WHICH REPRESENTS A 20 PERCENT INCREASE OVER THE PRIOR QUARTER'S DIVIDEND AMOUNT."}